Finicky

Portions of PwrRoute are derived from Finicky
(https://github.com/johnste/finicky): Finicky's configuration API, embedded as
crates/pwrroute-engine/assets/finickyConfigAPI.js; the test configs taken from
Finicky's examples; and Finicky's browsers.json and launcher, the basis of
crates/pwrroute-browsers (its data/browsers.json, the copy in
tests/fixtures/finicky-browsers.json, and its profile and launch code). Those
portions are used under the following license:

